# Global indexing-only ignore patterns for Kilo IDX.
# Copy this file to ~/.kilocode/.kiloindexignore on any machine where you run Kilo.
# It excludes data/model/binary files and common output directories from indexing
# while leaving them accessible to agent tools when explicitly targeted.

# === Common data / output directories (type-based, not project-specific) ===
Data/
data/
data_roots/
datasets/
checkpoints/
weights/
runs/
logs/

